My project: My Weird Magic Academy Life — a comedy-focused 2D magic academy life simulator made with Unity.
Smallest playable version: A small playable prototype where the player can manage stats and progress through several in-game days.


Github status: GitHub repository created with initial project setup and README completed.


Biggest risk: Finding suitable game assets that match the visual style and scope of the project may take more time than expected.


What my game is：A humorous magic academy life simulation game where the player attends a low-ranked magic school after failing to enter a prestigious academy.


What the player does: The player explores the academy, manages time and character stats and makes choices that affect progression and endings.


What I will build as my vertical slice:
One academy area
Basic stat system
Time progression
One or two class activities
Simple UI and dialogue system
A short playable gameplay loop


